</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I have drawn you,</l><l>With lovingkindness.</l><l>For I have called you,</l><l>And gathered you.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The King has brought me,</l><l>Into His chambers.</l><l>We will extol,</l><l>His love, more than wine.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O let Him kiss me,</l><l>My Beloved.</l><l>My heart is with Thee,</l><l>Till the end.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
